            <ArticleTitle>Pain assessment and management in the patient with mild to moderate cognitive impairment.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>354-9; quiz 360-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The gold standard for pain screening and assessment is the patient report. Research shows that many patients with mild to moderate cognitive impairment retain the ability to report pain. All patients should be given the opportunity to self-report their pain using valid and reliable tools.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
